            "num": "1",
            "titleEn": "The Preposition 'm' (𓅓): in, with, from",
            "descEn": "Has three main contextual meanings depending on the sentence:",
            "indicatorAr": "حرف الجر m: في / بواسطة / من",
            "subPoints": [
              {
                "label": "1. Locative (المكانية)",
                "text": "in",
                "examples": [
                  {
                    "h": "𓅓 𓊪:𓏏*𓇯",
                    "trans": "m pt",
                    "mean": "in the sky"
                  },
                  {
                    "h": "𓅓 𓂧*𓊪:𓏏*𓊛",
                    "trans": "m dpt",
                    "mean": "in a boat"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "label": "2. Instrumental (الوسيلة والأداة)",
                "text": "by means of, with",
                "examples": [
                  {
                    "h": "𓅓 𓐍:𓏏 𓏏:𓈖",
                    "trans": "m ḫt tn",
                    "mean": "with this thing"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "label": "3. Separative (الانفصال والابتداء)",
                "text": "from, out of",
                "examples": [
                  {
                    "h": "𓅓 𓃀*𓅱 𓊪:𓈖",
                    "trans": "m bw pn",
                    "mean": "from this place"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "num": "2",
            "titleEn": "The Preposition 'n' (𓈖): to, for (Dative - To Persons)",
