                "label": "2. Destination / Inanimate (نحو الجمادات)",
                "text": "towards a physical location",
                "examples": [
                  {
                    "h": "𓂋 𓃀*𓅱 𓊪:𓈖",
                    "trans": "r bw pn",
                    "mean": "to this place"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "num": "4",
            "titleEn": "The Preposition 'ḥnʿ' (𓎛𓈖𓂝): together with, and",
